### Promote DC01 and create the first AD forest/domain

Install-ADDSForest `
    -DomainName "engineering.local" `
    -DomainNetbiosName "ENGINEERING" `
    -InstallDNS:$true


### Verify computer domain state

Get-CimInstance Win32_ComputerSystem |
    Select-Object Name, Domain, PartOfDomain


### Verify Active Directory domain

Get-ADDomain


### Verify Domain Controller

Get-ADDomainController


### Verify installed AD DS / DNS roles

Get-WindowsFeature AD-Domain-Services, DNS
